   "The catalog prints two nearly identical outcome lists: a numbered list of ABFSE-required 'Program Learning Outcomes' in the description (capitalized, e.g. 'Explain the importance...') and a bulleted 'Student Learning Outcomes' list (lowercase). The Student Learning Outcomes list is recorded; the numbered list differs only in initial capitalization.",
   "Catalog titles FSE 297 'Practicum in Funeral Service Education' while the closed list calls it 'Internship in Funeral Service Education'; same code.",
